  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog - Gasolutions.Core\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n## [1.0.8]\n### Added\n- Add CHANGELOG.md file to document changes and updates\n## [1.7.0]\n### Refactoring\n- Code refactoring and improvements across all modules\n- Enhanced project structure for better maintainability\n- Improved documentation and API consistency\n---\n## [1.6.0] - Previous\n### Moved\n- **Result Pattern** moved to `Gasolutions.Core.Patterns.Result` NuGet package\n- **IPort Interface** moved to `Gasolutions.Core.Interfaces.Ports` NuGet package\n- **IRepository Interface** and implementations moved to `Gasolutions.Core.Repository` NuGet package\n- **Beautiful GUID Extensions** moved to `Gasolutions.Core.BeautifulGuid` NuGet package\n### Rationale\nMoved domain-specific patterns and extensions to dedicated NuGet packages for better separation of concerns and reusability across projects.\n---\n## Integration with Other Packages\nThis project now serves as the core foundation and coordinates with:\n- `Gasolutions.Core.Patterns.Result` - Result pattern implementation\n- `Gasolutions.Core.Interfaces.Ports` - Port interfaces for Clean Architecture\n- `Gasolutions.Core.Repository` - Generic repository pattern with RepoDB\n- `Gasolutions.Core.BeautifulGuid` - GUID extension methods\n- `Gasolutions.Core.Interfaces.RefitHttpClient` - Refit HTTP client factories",
